Usage
----------------------------------------------------
Follow these steps to set up and run the simulation:

1. Set the Working Directory

Ensure you are in the vcs_sim directory before running the commands.

2. Clean Previous Builds

make clean

This removes any existing compiled files and ensures a fresh build.

3. Link the Necessary Files

make link

This step links the required dependencies.

4. Compile the Simulation

make vcs

This compiles the project and prepares it for execution.

5. Run with a Custom Program File

If you want to pass a specific program file, use:

make vcs PROGRAM=program_files/<file_name>

Note: Only .mem files should be passed as <file_name>.

Prerequisites
--------------

1. Synopsys Tools

Ensure you have loaded the Synopsys tools before running any commands.

2. Python Compatibility

Ensure you have a compatible Python version installed.

If needed, you can check your version using:

python --version


